Analysis Summary
================================================================================
The BZ option data represents actual market prices for futures options.
Black-76 is the correct model for futures-style margining options.
The RMSPE of ~10,000% indicates market prices deviate significantly from
Black-76 theoretical prices, which could be due to:
  - Bid-ask spreads and liquidity effects
  - Market microstructure effects (futures-style margining)
  - Potential data issues or different pricing conventions
